[0m⚙ [0mcompress {"topic":"Direct-rect review: source verification","content":[{"startId":"m0002","endId":"m0007","summary":"I read every changed source file and verified the 'direct rectangle editing' feature against the brief. Full findings below (all line numbers are worktree-current).\n\n## src/editor/ui/gestures.ts (902 lines) — VERIFIED CORRECT\n- `footprintGeometry` (43-90): halfWidth=(source.width·crop.width·scaleX)/2; edgeHandles = map(±halfW,0)/(0,±halfH). ALL handles incl. edgeHandles are bounds-clamped via `clampPoint` (80-88) when `bounds` given — so the deepseek 'edge handles not clamped' MINOR is ALREADY FIXED. Constants: MIN_ITEM_SCALE=0.01, HANDLE_SCREEN_RADIUS=22, ROTATE_HANDLE_OFFSET=36.\n- `directlyEditable` (116-124): visible && (raster|cutout|solid decal). Pattern solid → false.\n- `editableTransform` (126-144): solid decal→transform, solid pattern→null, raster→transform, cutout→synthetic {positionX/Y from centerX/Y, scaleX=rect.width, scaleY=rect.height, crop 1x1}.\n- `cutoutPatchFromTransformPatch` (146-160): positionX→centerX, positionY→centerY, rotationDeg→rotationDeg, scaleX→width, scaleY→height.\n- `startItemInteraction` (310-427): hit order rotate(330)→scale(346)→edge(365-401)→interior move(403-419)→tap. Edge loop guarded by `selectedLayer.kind !== \"raster\"` (367). `startLocal` (377-401) computed from ACTUAL pointer projected onto rotated axis (left/right: dx·cos+dy·sin; top/bottom: -dx·sin+dy·cos) — preserves grab offset so a clamped off-canvas handle does not jump. `handleRadiusCanvasPx()`=22/(rect.scale·viewport.scale) unchanged.\n- `applyItemMove` edge branch (570-606): converts pointer to local frame via inverse rotation (localX=dx·cos+dy·sin, localY=-dx·sin+dy·cos); width=Math.max(MIN_ITEM_SCALE, 2·startHalfWidth + direction·(localX−startLocal)); shiftX=direction·(width/2−startHalfWidth); then rotates shift back: positionX=center.x+shiftX·cos−shiftY·sin, positionY=center.y+shiftX·sin+shiftY·cos. VERIFIED BY HAND: right-edge drag → new right edge localX == pointer localX (1:1); left-edge → new left edge == pointer; opposite edge stays fixed; min-clamp yields {scaleX:0.01, positionX:56.005} for drag 456→10 (center 256, half 200); 90°-rotated cutout right-edge drag 256,456→256,496 yields width 440, centerX 256, centerY 276. The round-1 qwen '2× gain BLOCKER' is a FALSE POSITIVE (math is correct; expectations at gestures.test.ts:1046-1049 = {scaleX:450,positionX:281} etc. are correct).\n- wheel (770-806) / keyboard (808-866) gate on `directlyEditable` — decal solids included, pattern solids excluded. Wheel cutout uses layer.rect, solid/raster uses scaleBy(layer.transform, factor).\n\n## src/editor/state.ts (855 lines) — VERIFIED CORRECT\n- ItemSpec solid now `{kind:\"solid\"; color:string; transform:Transform}` (21).\n- `set-placement` reducer (523-527) rejects `current.kind !== \"raster\"` → rejects solids AND cutouts (the deepseek 1701 'set-placement still accepts solids' MINOR is ALREADY FIXED).\n- `patch-transform` reducer (534-554) rejects cutout AND `solid && placement!==\"decal\"` (538-545) → pattern solids can't be transformed (qwen/deepseek 'patch-transform accepts pattern solids' MINOR ALREADY FIXED).\n- `addItem` (595-656): solid path validates `isTransformValid(item.transform)`, hardcodes placement:\"decal\", copyTransform(item.transform). `solidDefaultTransform()` fully removed (grep confirms 0 refs).\n- `duplicateItem` preserves source placement (so old pattern solids stay pattern). No solid-pattern creation path anywhere (only solid creation is addSolid→decal; grep: designer-app.tsx:706 placement:\"pattern\" is for raster AI pattern).\n\n## src/editor/ui/designer-app.tsx — VERIFIED\n- `solidRectangleTransform` (79-89): positionX=template.width/2, positionY=template.height/2, scaleX=round(w·0.4), scaleY=round(h·0.3), crop 1x1. Tshirt→205×154 (avg 179.5→'Size 180'), shirt/pants 585×559→234×168 (centers 292.5/279.5).\n- `addSolid` (327-347) dispatches add-item solid with solidRectangleTransform; the only solid-creation call site.\n- `onSwatch` (349-356): selectedLayer.kind===\"solid\" → set-color (recolor, incl. legacy pattern solid), else addSolid.\n- `onPlacement` (551-583) guards `layer.kind !== \"raster\"` → no UI path sets solid placement.\n\n## src/editor/ui/sheets.tsx (592 lines) — VERIFIED\n- `isDecalSolid` (359-361). `fieldValue` size for cutout (373) and decal solid (398) both use `Math.max(1, Math.round((w+h)/2))` — the 'Size displays 0 below min' MINOR is ALREADY FIXED (clamped to ≥1). Raster size uses percent (`*100`).\n- `commitField` size (457-467): solid path commits uniform ratio using raw un-rounded average (`average=(scaleX+scaleY)/2; ratio=value/average; scaleX·ratio, scaleY·ratio`) → round-trip exact; cutout analog (432-438); raster `value/100`.\n- `visibleFields` (531-537): decal solid → FIELDS minus wide/tall (left,up,turn,size,see); pattern solid → see only; cutout → [left,up,turn,size]; raster → all FIELDS. CROP_FIELDS rendered only for raster (566-585). nonce-based useEffect resync (508-521) unchanged.\n- FIELDS.size decl = {min:1, step:1} (342) — display is floored at 1 but commit path still accepts value>0; residual cosmetic only.\n\n## src/editor/ui/workspace.tsx (405 lines) — VERIFIED\n- `cutoutFootprint` (93-106): footprintGeometry(transform{positionX/Y=rect.center,scaleX/scaleY=1}, source{rect.width,rect.height}, bounds inset16). `solidFootprint` (108-114): footprintGeometry(layer.transform, source{1,1}, bounds inset16).\n- Overlay draw (238-278): raster|cutout|decalSolid get corners+rotate+scale handles; edge handles drawn only when `layer.kind !== \"raster\"` (271-276), radius Math.max(4, template.width/100).\n- `itemFootprint` (338-364) returns null for `solid && placement!==\"decal\"` (344) → pattern solids never hit-testable.\n\n## src/editor/ui/editor-screen.tsx (346 lines) — VERIFIED\n- Selection bar (176-195): cutout→'Cut Out' label; solid decal→'Color' label (class cutout-selection-label); else segmented placement control. `isPlacementActive` (95-103) solid→value===\"full-map\"; `placementDisabled` (105-107) cutout always, solid for value!==\"full-map\" → legacy pattern solid shows 3 disabled buttons, no active; no UI resurrect path.\n\n## src/compositor/math.ts & compose.ts — VERIFIED\n- `isCropValid` (math 15-30): crop.x/y in [0,1), width/height>0 and ≤1−x/y.\n- `fillSolidCentered` (compose 186-194): translate(positionX,positionY)·rotate·scale(scaleX,scaleY)·fillRect(-0.5,-0.5,1,1) → decal solid is a scaleX×scaleY pixel rectangle. `drawDecal` (196-221) clips to garment panels. Pattern solid → `drawSolidPattern` (279-289) full-clothing clip-fill (compat preserved, compositor unchanged as settled).\n\n## Greps (conclusive)\n- `.field-group` single-use: styles.css:731 def + sheets.tsx:568 (Crop h3) only → global `grid-column:1/-1` harmless.\n- `solidDefaultTransform`: 0 references (removed).\n- `kind:\"solid\"` creation sites: state.ts addItem only (628-632, placement decal). designer-app.tsx:706 `placement:\"pattern\"` is raster (AI pattern).\n\n## CONCLUSION (all scrutiny areas pass)\n1. Edge-resize math correct (1:1 tracking, opposite edge fixed, center shifts half along rotated axis, min-clamp correct, cutout↔solid mapping consistent — hand-verified against all 6 drag test expectations incl. 90° rotation and clamp).\n2. Hit-testing: order intact, rasters excluded from edges, 44px radius unchanged, wheel/keyboard include decal solids exclude pattern solids.\n3. State/back-compat: add-item validates+hardcodes decal, set-placement rejects all non-rasters, patch-transform rejects pattern solids, duplicate preserves placement, no resurrection path.\n4. More sheet: px-vs-percent correct, ratio commit exact, per-kind field visibility correct, nonce resync correct. Residual: FIELDS.size min=1/step=1 while drag can produce sub-1 averages (display floored at 1; commit accepts >0) — purely cosmetic, no invalid state possible."}]}
